37310>>>        //  Hide header & apply nice background style
37310>>>        Send HideHeader to ghoWebApp
37311>>>        WebSet psCSSClass of ghoWebApp to "LoginBackground"
37312>>>    End_Procedure
37313>>>    
37313>>>End_Object
